    "## 8. 5-Minute Capstone Demo Outline\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1. The Question (1 Minute)\n",
    "- **Core Problem:** How can FlyRank systematically optimize content ranking, discovery, and relevance using automated data-driven pipelines instead of manual heuristics?\n",
    "- **Objective:** Build, evaluate, and benchmark a machine learning workflow to accurately predict content ranking outcomes and surface high-value insights.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 2. The Method (1 Minute)\n",
    "- **Approach:** Designed an end-to-end data processing and predictive modeling pipeline using Python, rigorous feature engineering, and robust cross-validation.\n",
    "- **Architecture:** Ingested structured production logs, engineered behavioral indicators, and tested multiple classification/regression models against a naive baseline.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 3. One Chart (1 Minute)\n",
    "- **Visualization:** The feature importance and precision-recall trade-off plots (visualized in `results_precision50_and_features.png`).\n",
    "- **Key Insight:** Highlights the primary engagement and ranking features that drive model performance versus noise.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4. One Honest Result (1 Minute)\n",
    "- **Finding:** The model successfully outperformed the baseline on primary content tiers, demonstrating reliable predictive capability on high-density data splits.\n",
    "- **Limitation:** Performance tapered on long-tail, sparse query categories, pointing to necessary future data augmentation steps.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 5. Recommendation (1 Minute)\n",
    "- **Actionable Next Step:** Embed the scoring module directly into FlyRank's staging content pipeline to automate real-time ranking adjustments and optimize resource allocation.\n",
    "\n",
